  "term": "Kanner’s syndrome",
  "definition": "Kanner’s syndrome is a childhood-onset disorder involving major difficulties in social interaction and communication, along with a very limited range of activities and interests. Its presentation can differ widely depending on a person’s age and developmental level.",
